 preComment: 0 (***************************************************************************)
             1 (* a .. b  is defined to equal  {i \in Int : (a \leq i) /\ (i \leq b)}     *)
             2 (* where  Int  is the set of all integers.                                 *)
             3 (*                                                                         *)
             4 (* a % b  and  a \div b  are defined so that for any integers  a  and  b   *)
             5 (* with  b > 0 , the following formula is true:                            *)
             6 (*                                                                         *)
             7 (*    a  =  b * (a \div b) + (a % b)                                       *)
             8 (***************************************************************************)
